</div><p>Whatever you use, the only essential piece is your <code>social.org</code>.</p>
<p>If every Org Social server shut down tomorrow, what would you lose? Convenience. And what would you keep? Your file, intact, on your disk. You upload it anywhere else and keep posting.</p>
